/* preview.callout.end */
"VoiceVista Street Preview ended." = "Pregled ulice u aplikaciji VoiceVista je završen.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista announces automatic callouts only when you are on the Surroundings tab." = "VoiceVista reprodukuje automatske najave samo kada ste na kartici Okolina.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista calculates navigation instructions using only the first and last waypoints. Intermediate waypoints are not included." = "VoiceVista će izračunati uputstva za navigaciju samo od prve do poslednje tačke na ovoj ruti. Ne koristi nikakve međutačke.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista can calculate reference waypoints between the starting location and destination." = "VoiceVista može izračunati referentne tačke puta na osnovu početne i odredišne lokacije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista can generate a reversed route by placing the waypoints in reverse order. You may need to adjust them before starting guidance." = "VoiceVista može da generiše novi obrnuti put sa tačkama obrnutim redosledom za vašu pogodnost. Možda ćete morati da podesite putne tačke za obrnuti put pre nego što započnete smernice.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista can read files generated by any app if they follow the GPX standard." = "Datoteke koje generiše bilo koja aplikacija mogu se čitati sve dok se pridržavaju GPX standarda.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista cannot determine your current location. Try again later." = "Imamo problema da pronađemo vašu trenutnu lokaciju. Pokušajte ponovo kasnije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista could not read this GPX file." = "Nije moguće analizirati ovu GPX datoteku";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista could not start the GPX simulator." = "VoiceVista nije mogao da pokrene GPX simulator.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista downloads map data as you move so it can describe nearby places. If VoiceVista has problems or uses too much storage, clear the stored map data. VoiceVista will then re-download data near your current location." = "VoiceVista preuzima podatke mape dok šetate okolo tako da vam može reći o stvarima i mestima oko vas. Ako imate problema sa VoiceVistom ili on koristi previše memorije, možete da obrišete uskladištene podatke mape, a VoiceVista će samo ponovo učitati podatke mape u blizini trenutne lokacije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista iCloud Storage Is Full" = "VoiceVista iCloud skladište puno";

/* terms_of_use.safety_notice */
"VoiceVista is a navigation aid and should not replace mobility skills, awareness of your surroundings, or good judgment. Use caution while navigating because VoiceVista uses third-party mapping data that may be incomplete or inaccurate." = "VoiceVista je navigaciono pomagalo i ne bi trebalo da se koristi umesto veština mobilnosti, biti svestan svog okruženja i dobrog rasuđivanja. Budite oprezni prilikom kretanja kroz okruženje dok se podaci o mapiranju koji su ugrađeni u program VoiceVista preuzimaju iz programa nezavisnog proizvođača i zato mogu postojati ograničenja sa tačnošću predstavljenih informacija.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is back online. All features are available." = "VoiceVista je ponovo na mreži sa punom funkcionalnošću.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is building the local map. Please wait a moment." = "VoiceVista pravi lokalnu mapu. Molimo sačekajte trenutak.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is connecting to your headphones. Please wait…" = "VoiceVista se povezuje sa vašim slušalicama. Trenutak...";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is in Sleep mode and does not use Location Services or download data." = "VoiceVista je trenutno u režimu spavanja. U ovom režimu, VoiceVista ne koristi usluge lokacije niti preuzima podatke.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is in Sleep mode." = "VoiceVista je trenutno u režimu spavanja.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is in Snooze mode and will wake automatically when you leave your current location." = "VoiceVista je trenutno u režimu dremeže. Automatski će se probuditi kada napustite trenutnu lokaciju.";

/* %1$@ is the name of the monitoring location. %2$@ is the distance to wakeup to start audio beacon */
"VoiceVista is monitoring “%1$@” with an activation range of %2$@. When you enter this range, VoiceVista will wake up and set the marker as the audio beacon." = "VoiceVista nadgleda „%1$@“ sa opsegom aktiviranja od %2$@. Kada uđete u ovaj opseg, VoiceVista će se probuditi i postaviti označivač kao zvučni signal.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is not connected to your headphones. Make sure they are turned on and near your phone." = "VoiceVista trenutno nije povezana sa vašim slušalicama. Uverite se da su slušalice uključene i blizu telefona.";

/* general.error.heading */
"VoiceVista is not sure which direction you are facing. Hold your phone flat or begin walking, then try again." = "VoiceVista nije siguran u kom pravcu se suočavate. Držite telefon ravno ili počnite da hodate i pokušajte ponovo";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is offline. Some features are limited." = "Nema internet veze; neke funkcije su ograničene u režimu rada van mreže.";

/* devices.callouts.check_audio.airpods.disconnected */
"VoiceVista is searching for your AirPods. Make sure they are connected to your phone." = "VoiceVista traži vaše AirPods. Uverite se da su povezani sa telefonom.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista is updating the map data. Try again later." = "VoiceVista trenutno ažurira podatke mape. Molimo pokušajte ponovo kasnije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista saves complete snapshots of your markers and routes in separate backup files whenever you add or remove a marker or route. You can restore these backups if iCloud synchronization causes data loss." = "Kompletni snimci markera i ruta se čuvaju u odvojenim datotekama rezervnih kopija kad god ih dodate ili uklonite. Ove rezervne kopije možete da vratite ako su vaši iCloud podaci izgubljeni zbog problema sa sinhronizacijom.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista stores map data to reduce mobile data and battery use. After you clear it, VoiceVista must download the map data again." = "VoiceVista skladišti podatke mape da bi smanjio potrošnju podataka i baterije. Za brisanje sačuvanih podataka mape biće potrebno da VoiceVista ponovo preuzme podatke.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista syncs markers and routes between devices through iCloud. If you encounter a sync issue, you can reset this synced data." = "VoiceVista sinhronizuje oznake i rute između uređaja putem iClouda. Ako dođe do problema sa sinhronizacijom, možete resetovati ove sinhronizovane podatke.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista warns you when GPS accuracy exceeds the selected threshold. Lower values require greater accuracy." = "Upozori korisnika kada tačnost GPS-a pređe definisani prag (niže vrednosti ukazuju na veću tačnost).";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista was unable to connect to your headphones. Please try again later." = "VoiceVista nije mogao da se poveže sa vašim slušalicama. Pokušajte ponovo kasnije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista will return to the Surroundings tab and place an audio beacon on your first waypoint. When you arrive, the beacon will advance to the next waypoint." = "VoiceVista će se vratiti na karticu Okolina i postaviti zvučni signal na prvu putnu tačku. Kada stignete, signal će preći na sledeću putnu tačku.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista will return to the Surroundings tab and start the audio beacon. Hold your phone flat, listen for the beacon, and turn toward it." = "VoiceVista će se vratiti na karticu Okolina i pokrenuti zvučni signal. Držite telefon ravno, osluškujte signal i okrenite se ka njemu.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"VoiceVista's iCloud storage is full. Delete some existing markers before creating a new one." = "iCloud skladište za ovu aplikaciju je puno. Da biste kreirali novi označivač, moraćete da oslobodite prostor uklanjanjem nekih postojećih označivača.";

