"What's My Location?" = "Koja je moja lokacija?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When enabled, automatic callouts include the nearest marker regardless of distance. When disabled, each marker uses the range of its linked POI category." = "Kada je omogućeno, automatske najave uključuju najbliži označivač bez obzira na udaljenost. Kada je onemogućeno, svaki označivač koristi domet povezane POI kategorije.";

/* permissions.info.1 */
"When navigating with VoiceVista, an audio beacon guides you while callouts describe locations around and ahead of you." = "Dok se krećete pomoću aplikacije VoiceVista, zvučni signal vas vodi, a najave opisuju lokacije oko vas i ispred vas.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When queuing is off, intersection callouts interrupt any current callout." = "Kada je red čekanja isključen, najava raskrsnice prekida trenutnu najavu.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"When this setting is on, VoiceVista pauses callouts and other audio while another media app is playing. Return to VoiceVista to resume callouts." = "Kada je ovo podešavanje uključeno, VoiceVista pauzira najave i drugi zvuk dok druga medijska aplikacija reprodukuje sadržaj. Vratite se u VoiceVista da biste nastavili najave.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"While following a route with VoiceVista, you will be notified when you arrive at each waypoint, and the audio beacon will automatically advance to the next waypoint." = "Dok pratite rutu uz VoiceVista, bićete obavešteni kada stignete do svake tačke, a zvučni signal će automatski preći na sledeću tačku.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"With verbose mode off, the same road name will not be repeated after an intersection." = "Kada je opširni režim isključen, isti naziv puta se neće ponavljati posle raskrsnice.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Within how many feet of this location should VoiceVista activate the audio beacon?" = "Na koliko stopa od ove lokacije VoiceVista treba da aktivira zvučni signal?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Within how many meters of this location should VoiceVista activate the audio beacon?" = "Na koliko metara od ove lokacije VoiceVista treba da aktivira zvučni signal?";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Yes" = "Da";

