/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You are already within the monitoring range." = "Već ste u okviru regiona za nadgledanje.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can align the marker with your current location or move it 5 meters in a selected direction." = "Postoji nekoliko opcija za podešavanje lokacije označivača. Pored poravnavanja sa trenutnom lokacijom, možete da gurnete označivač da biste ga premestili 5 metara u izabranom smeru.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can customize which POI supercategories are announced by What's Around Me and What's Ahead of Me." = "Možete da prilagodite koje superkategorije POI su najavljene pomoću komandi 'Šta je oko mene' i 'Šta je ispred'.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can customize which POI supercategories are announced in different scenarios." = "Možete prilagoditi koje superkategorije POI su najavljene za različite scenarije.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can customize which POI supercategories are announced while you are in a vehicle." = "Možete da prilagodite koje superkategorije POI se najavljuju dok ste u vozilu.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can customize which POI supercategories are announced while you are walking." = "Možete da prilagodite koje superkategorije POI se najavljuju dok hodate.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can now explore virtual locations by teleporting between intersections and places." = "Sada možete da istražujete virtuelne lokacije teleportujući se između raskrsnica i mesta.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can select waypoints from your markers." = "Putne tačke možete izabrati sa liste označivača.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can teleport between nearby intersections and places to understand their relative distances." = "Možete se teleportovati između obližnjih raskrsnica i mesta za istraživanje njihovih veza na daljinu.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can try searching by name or address." = "Pretragu možete pokušati da pretražite po imenu ili adresi.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can turn off sound effects for specific POI supercategories while keeping their spoken announcements." = "Možete isključiti zvučne efekte za određene POI superkategorije, omogućavajući da se objavi samo tekst POI.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can turn off the entry and exit sound effects used by exploration commands." = "Možete onemogućiti ulazak i izlaz zvučne efekte za istraživanje komande.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can't delete a marker while a beacon is set on it." = "Ne možete izbrisati označivač dok je na njemu postavljen signal.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You can't delete a route while it is being used for guidance." = "Ne možete izbrisati rutu dok ona obezbeđuje smernice.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You have changed the waypoints in this route." = "Promenili ste putne tačke ove rute.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You will be teleported to the location you selected." = "Bićete teleportovani na lokaciju koju ste izabrali.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You will be teleported to the middle of the street near the selected location. Hold the phone like a pointer and turn slowly to hear street names. When you face the street you want to follow, tap Go to advance to the next intersection." = "Bićete teleportovani na sredinu ulice u blizini lokacije koju ste izabrali. Koristeći telefon kao pokazivač, polako se okrećite, a imena ulica će biti pozvana dok se okrenete. Kada se suočavate sa ulicom koju želite da idete, dodirnite Idi i preći ćete na sledeću raskrsnicu.";

/* Title for alert that is displayed when importing a marker. */
"You've received a marker: %@" = "Dobili ste oznaku: '%@'";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"You've received a route: %@" = "Primili ste rutu: '%@'";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your AirPods are ready to use, so you can put your phone in your pocket and go. VoiceVista tracks the direction of your head, so you do not need to hold the phone." = "Vaši AirPods su spremni za upotrebu, tako da možete da stavite telefon u džep i krenete! VoiceVista prati pravac vaše glave tako da ne morate da držite telefon u ruci.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your current location is not the route's first waypoint. Select a nearby waypoint to start the route." = "Vaša trenutna lokacija nije prva međutačka definisana u ruti. Izaberite jednu od najbližih tačaka da biste započeli rutu.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your headphones are connected to VoiceVista, but they must be calibrated before use. VoiceVista will let you know whenever calibration is needed, such as each time you turn them on." = "Slušalice su uspešno povezane sa VoiceVistom, ali moraju biti kalibrisane pre upotrebe. VoiceVista će vas obavestiti kad god je potrebna kalibracija slušalica, na primer svaki put kada je uključite.";

/* devices.callouts.needs_calibration */
"Your headphones need to be calibrated. Take them off and gently shake them in all directions." = "Vaše slušalice moraju biti kalibrisane. Sklonite ih sa glave i nežno ih protresite u svim pravcima.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your headphones need to be updated before they can connect to VoiceVista." = "Vaše slušalice moraju da se ažuriraju da bi mogla da se povežu sa VoiceVistom.";

/* No comment provided by engineer. */
"Your privacy settings are preventing access to Motion & Fitness. Adjust them in the Settings app." = "Izgleda da vaša podešavanja privatnosti sprečavaju korišćenje funkcije Kretanje i kondicija. Molimo vas da izvršite potrebna podešavanja u aplikaciji Podešavanja.";

